nd_Logos_520px_040126_Figma.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2104/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Figma.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2104/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Figma.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2104/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Figma.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2104/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Figma.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2104/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Figma.jpg","The world of design, once disconnected and solitary, is now one of real-time collaboration and community—thanks to the online creative tools of design powerhouse Figma. Customer love for their products is unparalleled, from Figma itself to FigJam and Figma Community. Users uniformly praise the ways in which Figma fosters a transparent, community-driven, open source design process. By providing a hyper-convenient digital space for teams to brainstorm and execute together, Figma is making design fun again. We’re honored to accompany the exceptional team at Figma on their continued journey of excellence. Much like design, the best B2B SaaS companies are built through a process of enduring collaboration.","Get to know Figma, the powerhouse suite of design tools that enable real-time collaboration, transparency and community—and are making design fun again.","Figma - IVP Portfolio - VC for B2B SaaS Companies","Figma - IVP Portfolio ","A design platform for teams who build products together",{"id":32,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"255","2021-01-01","https://careers.ivp.com/companydetail.php?cid=8056&v=83","Dylan Field","/content/figma-designing-the-future/","Read the Funding Announcement","https://www.linkedin.com/company/figma/",{"id":40,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":41,"assetUrlXs":42,"assetUrlSm":43,"assetUrlMd